      "created_at": "2017-07-22T18:50:05.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Was woken up to a pleasant surprise today! Perfect for a Saturday morning adventure, Lazer Ryderz was on my doorstep!</p><p>I was surprised on how long each Ryder box is. No problem with it, just didn't realize each one would be so tall.</p><p>The special finish on each card is awesome, reminds me of old trapper keeper decals my sisters used to have.</p><p>Inside of the boxes were a bit of a mess from shipping, but the insert made figuring out what went where pretty easy.</p><p>The promo characters are cool, still trying to figure out where I can keep them in the boxes.</p>",
